---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

// Unlisted: noindex, kept out of the sitemap (astro.config.mjs) and not linked from anywhere. Registered with WHOOP.
---

<Layout title="THE LAB - Privacy" description="Privacy notice for THE LAB." variant="tool" noindex>
  <main class="lab mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20">
    <h1>THE LAB - Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lab-updated">Last updated: 25 October 2026</p>

    <section>
      <p>
        THE LAB is a personal performance-tracking tool used by one person, its owner, Ben Carrington.
        It is not a public service, and there are no other users or accounts.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What it reads</h2>
      <p>
        With the owner's explicit permission, through WHOOP's developer API, it reads the owner's own
        recovery, sleep, daily strain, workout, profile and body-measurement data. It may also read the
        owner's own training data from other services the owner connects (for example Strava and
        Garmin).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
      <p>
        The data is stored in a database on the owner's own computer. The authorisation tokens that let
        it read WHOOP data are also kept on that computer, in a file with restricted permissions, and
        are never published or committed to source control.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Who can see it</h2>
      <p>
        Nobody else. For personal coaching analysis, the owner's data may be read by an AI assistant
        (Claude, from Anthropic) in sessions the owner starts, under the owner's own account. The data
        is not sold, shared with advertisers or used for marketing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        THE LAB has no analytics or tracking. This web page is served from trailhustle.com, whose own
        analytics are described in the site's <a href="/legal#privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Control</h2>
      <p>
        The owner can revoke THE LAB's access at any time in the WHOOP app (connected apps settings),
        and can delete the stored data by deleting the local database.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:ben@trailhustle.com">ben@trailhustle.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .lab {
    color: var(--color-ink-mute);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lab h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .lab-updated {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }

  .lab section {
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .lab section:first-of-type {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .lab h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .lab p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lab a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-rule);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .lab a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-ink);
  }
</style>
